    "html": "<p>It takes an object two seconds to move from point A to point B along the path shown in the diagram.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the average speed and the magnitude of the average velocity of the object?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Average speed</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Magnitude of average velocity</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + 2 \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + 2 \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4 + \\pi\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
